<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-FIRST ROUND RESULTS IN MENS ATP TENNIS TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FIRST ROUND RESULTS IN MENS ATP TENNIS TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in</p>
<p>the $425,000 Mens ATP Tennis Tournament on Tuesday: (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Frederik Fetterlein (Denmark) beat Roberto Carretero (Spain)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>5-Alberto Beratasegui (Spain) beat Guillermo Canas (Argentina)</p>
<p>6-7 (8-10), 6-1, 6-4</p>
<p>5-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat David Prinosil (Germany) 2-6, 6-3, 6-2 Martin Sinner (Germany) beat 4-Felix Mantilla (Spain) 5-7, 6-4, 4-0. Mantilla disqualified for unsportsmanlike conduct.  </p>
<p>Andrej Medwedew (Ukraine) beat Daniel Elsner (Germany) 6-4, 6-4 Renzo Furlan (Italy) beat Oleg Ogorodow (Usbekistan) 2-6, 6-4, 6-1</p>
</text>
